    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Los Angeles International Airport",
      "LOS ANGELES INTERNATIONAL\n\"JET-AGE\" AIRPORT\nSpectacular aerial view of the magnificent facility\nnow\nunder\nconstruction which\nscheduled\ncompletion in 1961 — Reproduced from an artist's\nrendition. This airport covers 265 acres and is\ndesigned\naccommodate 23 million passengers\nby 1970. Airline terminal buildings, operating as\nindependent units, are\nlocated along the perimeter\nof the 5,000 car parking area.\nP39335\n25\n'Plastichrome\"\nLy Colourpichure, Boslon 15, Mass., U.S. A.\nDISTRIBUTED\nBY\nMITOCK \u0026 SONS, 13561\nVENTURA BLVD., SHERMAN OAKS, CALIF.\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nADDRESS ONLY\n2015.166.2019"
    ],
